 of cafes in the country compared to the population.Through this Daegu Coffee & Cafe Festa, which will connect daily life, taste, and lifestyle, we would like to present the direction of a new cultural platform and urban coffee festival","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Daegu","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Daegu_EXCO_4.jpg/1280px-Daegu_EXCO_4.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Daegu_EXCO_4.jpg/500px-Daegu_EXCO_4.jpg","w":1200,"h":904,"author":"Syonsi","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Daegu_EXCO_4.jpg"}},{"id":"daegu_wv_gypsy_rock","areaId":"daegu","name":"Gypsy Rock","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":35.89261,"lng":128.60376},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"daegu_wv_gypsy_rock","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["gypsyrock","daegu"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"}]},"bestLight":"night","summary":"A great underground \"rock bar\" in the KNU North Gate area. The lighting is a little dark, the air a little damp, the music a bit too loud, but Gypspy Rock remains one of Daegu's best watering holes. The owner of the bar, Dohan, speaks English well and is more than happy to take any request songs from his voluminous library of rock music. The bar is busiest on Friday and Saturday nights, when both ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daegu"},{"id":"daegu_wv_seomun_market","areaId":"daegu","name":"Seomun Market","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":35.87072,"lng":128.59694},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daegu_wv_seomun_market","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://seomun.eneeds.gethompy.com","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["seomunmarket","daegu"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Seomun Market, the largest traditional market in Daegu, was historically referred to as Daegu Market. Along with Pyeongyang Market and Ganggyeong Market, it was known as one of the three largest markets in the Joseon Dynasty. Its night market, opened in 2016, becomes a hot attraction where people come to enjoy delicious food and the romantic atmosphere.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daegu"},{"id":"daegu_wv_samsong_bakery","areaId":"daegu","name":"Samsong Bakery","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8688,"lng":128.59344},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daegu_wv_samsong_bakery","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://m.ssbnc.kr","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["samsongbakery","daegu"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"}]},"summary":"Samsong Bakery since 1957, is the oldest bakery from Daegu. The corn bread is the most popular bread, it is also known as 'drug bread' due to its addictive taste. Filled with cream and whole kernels of corn, sweet cream cheese and diced vegetables, the store sells about 5000 per day on average.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daegu"},{"id":"daegu_wv_wanggeomi_restaurant","areaId":"daegu","name":"Wanggeomi Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8685,"lng":128.6067},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daegu_wv_wanggeomi_restaurant","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["wanggeomirestaurant","daegu"],"hours":{"